    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hagari sea Shumwaheeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida gatmooda Abramu was Sarayi miighwanyas diibiga. Abeeda gwandeawa huda was soomjeanda bea ng'eanyiida Misri siguura gheawungaaschi Hagari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwayeesha Sarayi Abramu, “Ng'ula, niweadanaan NG'UTAMIIDA nyasooda diibiga; una mideawana huda gadiyeeda; gwadeepa danyas diibiga aba niny.” Hean gooleeysiit Abramu ghuuta Sarayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea niibiida Abramu ng'eanyiida Ganaani gweanyeew damanamughuush, ghwaat Sarayiheeda was gatmooda Abramu Hagari bea ng'eanyiida Misri nea hudaanyi bea gadiyeeda, amang'ata ghoadaw Abramu nea siyeadaanyi gil ghoah gatmoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Abramu heeda Hagari, ak gagweayiit; ama muchu nea ghwadaah gideaba nigweayiit, gang'ula ak gafool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Sarayi Abramu, “Gagasa ng'asheanda muy isinnean aniini eesineey ang'iing'i! Geagoonyeey hudeanyu bea gadiyeeda ghoah gatmoadaang'u, iidu nea ghwadaah gideaba nigweayiit, hean gafoolan. Gagasa gooheeli NG'UTAMIIDA siida doabiiw aba aniini ea ang'iing'i!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Abramu Sarayi, “Ng'ula, hudaang'u bea gadiyeeda gwanda geatingaagu; simana gidigasayi.” Hit gwasima Sarayi huda ng'asheega munyas, ak ghaghuudaada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghwanyasa malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA gheang'deenda aba dareapcheeda, gheang'deenda mida naweeda gal Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Hagari, huda gadiyeeda bea Sarayi ang'iing'i gileabu yeenu ak gigali yeenu?” Ak gwayeesha huda, “Aniini ghaghuudaani heeda gatmooda siguura Sarayi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA huda, “Biikta heedeaba gatmoodida ak gihuuwi soomjeandaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA huda, “Gaydagoonyi jeacheenga saang'a manda siida jea ghoamu gwayiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA huda, “Ng'ula, gaynyasa baleanda was baleanda; ak gayguureewana gheawungaaschi Shumwaheeli; aba gideaba niyiiy Ng'utamiida sawanadeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobiideata orjeedang'u digeeda dareabeeta, ak gaygwajaluudayi giliwas sih nea buuneeda gwajaluudayi niny; ak gaygwasheagiida buweadeagaaschi sean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi abalool niny, “Ang'iing'i guwoosi ASEETA ang'wearda;” aba gideaba gwayi, “Aba huumwa aniini naadaayi ASEETA ak geapteadi nea geawooschi majeek ak geawooschi majeek iing'ata deakteaba niny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu healadeedida geeguura Beer-lahai-roi; nea gwanda dageascheeda Gadeshi ea dea Beredi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gwajiilsa Hagari Abramu baleanda; ak gang'asa Abramu orjeedaanyi jih Hagari gheawunga siguura Shumwaheeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Abramu gaba gweanyeew seedam ea lah damanda jiilsa Hagari Abramu Shumwaheeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
